<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <title>StuTrack</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f172a;
            --surface: #111827;
            --accent: #38bdf8;
            --accent-strong: #0ea5e9;
            --text: #e2e8f0;
            --muted: #94a3b8;
            --border: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
            --radius: 24px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top center, #1e2c42 0%, #0f172a 55%);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 2;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 1200px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .brand strong {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 24px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .hero {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
            gap: 48px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-copy h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            line-height: 0.95;
        }

        .hero-copy p {
            color: var(--muted);
            max-width: 620px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .button,
        .button-secondary {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 16px 26px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        }

        .button {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8, #0ea5e9);
            color: #0f172a;
            box-shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.16);
        }

        .button-secondary {
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.32);
            color: var(--text);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        }

        .button:hover,
        .button-secondary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .hero-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.92);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.14);
            padding: 32px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .hero-card h2 {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero-card p {
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .stats {
            display: grid;
            gap: 16px;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }

        .stat {
            background: #0f172a;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 18px 20px;
        }

        .stat strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        section {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            gap: 24px;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 28px;
            min-height: 220px;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.98rem;
        }

        .callout {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12), rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.08));
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 30px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
            gap: 24px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .callout h2 {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 1.45rem;
        }

        .callout p {
            color: var(--muted);
            max-width: 610px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <main class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="brand">
                <strong>STUTRACK</strong>
                <span>Smart Expense Tracker with Budget Reminders for Students</span>
            </div>
            <nav class="nav-links">
                <a href="#features">Features</a>
                <a href="#about">About</a>
                <a href="#create-account">Log In</a>
                <a href="#create-account">Create Account</a>
            </nav>
        </header>

        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <h1>Track spending, protect your budget, and stay ahead every month.</h1>
                <p>Manage your student budget effortlessly. Add expenses in seconds, view spending summaries, check your
                    budget
                    health, and get reminders before you overspend. Stay financially disciplined every month.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a class="button" href="#cta">Launch Now</a>
                    <a class="button-secondary" href="#features">See Features</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <aside class="hero-card">
                <h2>What your app does</h2>
                <p>StuTrack: Smart Expense Tracker with Budget reminders for Students is a conceptual financial
                    management
                    system designed to help students organize their money by tracking expenses, setting budgets, and
                    receiving
                    notification when nearing spending limits. It is not a widely released commercial app but rather a
                    proposed
                    tool often used in academic projects to explore how technology can support student financial
                    discipline</p>
                <div class="stats">
                    <div class="stat">
                        <strong>Monthly budget</strong>
                        Start by entering a fixed budget and keep every expense in line.
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat">
                        <strong>Budget Reminders</strong>
                        Receive warnings at 80% usage and reminders once spending exceeds the limit.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </section>

        <section id="features">
            <h2 style="font-size:2rem; margin-bottom: 18px;">Key features</h2>
            <div class="features-grid">
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Add Expense</h3>
                    <p>Record spending with category labels like Food, Transportation, School supplies, and more.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <h3>View Expenses</h3>
                    <p>Review all recorded expenses in a clear list so you always know where your money goes.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <h3>View Total Spending</h3>
                    <p>See the current total of all recorded expenses in one simple summary.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <h3>Check Budget</h3>
                    <p>Track budget usage as a percentage and get helpful feedback before you overspend.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <br><br>
        <section id="create-account">
            <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 2rem;">Ready to launch your budget tracker?</h2>
            <p style="text-align: center;">Use this website as a starting point for a <strong>student finance
                    tool</strong>
                that helps users add expenses, track totals, and stay within their budget.</p>
            <br>
            <p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button" href="sign in.html">Get Started</a>
                <a class="button-secondary" href="login.html">Already have an account</a>
            </p>
        </section>
        <br>
        <hr>
        <br>
        <footer>
            <p style="text-align: center; "> © 2026 StuTrack.</p>
        </footer>
        <br>
    </main>

</body>

</html
